---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
import NewsletterForm from '../../components/NewsletterForm.astro';
---
<Page
  title="Newsletter"
  heading="The Learning Curve Newsletter"
  description="Once a month: the research and developments shaping the future of learning, and a spotlight on products, courses and discoveries from subscribers we select at random."
  standfirst="Get featured, and stay ahead: each month we randomly select subscribers to feature their products, courses and learning discoveries, alongside the latest research on the future of learning."
>
  <p>
    Once a month, we bring together the stories worth reading, research worth understanding and technologies worth
    knowing about. From education and workplace learning to AI, emerging technologies and the changing business of
    learning.
  </p>
  <p>
    The subscriber spotlight puts the people building learning in front of the people buying and using it, and every
    subscriber can be selected.
  </p>
  <NewsletterForm placement="newsletter-page" />
  <h2>Inside each issue</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>What's happening:</b> The stories, developments and conversations shaping the learning industry.</li>
    <li><b>Research worth reading:</b> New studies and findings, translated into what they actually mean.</li>
    <li><b>Ideas to consider:</b> Fresh thinking, practical insights and perspectives on how learning is changing.</li>
    <li><b>Technology to watch:</b> One platform, tool or emerging technology worth taking a closer look at.</li>
    <li><b>Subscriber spotlight:</b> Products, courses and learning discoveries from subscribers we select at random.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    No sponsored content. No unnecessary noise. Just independent thinking and useful intelligence for people building
    the future of learning.
  </p>
</Page>
